DESCRIPTION:The Duke Department of Medicine Clinical Excellence Society in
 vites you to Medicine Grand Rounds on April 17\, featuring keynote speake
 r Jed D. Gonzalo\, MD\, MSc\, Senior Associate Dean for Medical Education
  at Virginia Tech Carilion School of Medicine and a national leader in he
 alth systems science. A panel discussion with Kathleen Cooney\, MD\, Chai
 r of the Duke University Department of Medicine\, and Tom Owens\, MD\, Ex
 ecutive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer for Duke University He
 alth System\, will follow\, focusing on strengthening support for frontli
 ne clinicians and advancing patient-centered care.
