CREATED:20260217T185009Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate Earth Day and showcase the action being l
 ed across the Duke and Durham community.\nOur official EarthFest theme fo
 r 2026 is "Sustainability from Campus to Community". We will be highlight
 ing that sustainability is fostered across a collaborative network. We al
 so hope to highlight the many scales of efforts and leadership that drive
  sustainable changes across our campus and community culture\, from Duke 
 to Durham. It is our goal to emphasize that sustainability isn't a one si
 ze fits all solution\, but rather\, presents an opportunity for each of u
 s to find a unique access point. We don't need a handful of people doing 
 sustainability perfectly\; we need many people doing sustainability imper
 fectly.\n\nThere will be 40+ partners joining us to table -  from student
  organizations\, to academic departments\, to community organizations\, a
 nd more! Come by to celebrate\, play games\, join in interactive art acti
 vities\, and learn about more ways to get involved with the climate and s
 ustainability space.
DURATION:PT4H
