DESCRIPTION:What would it take to start a Student Cube Sat Team at Duke?\n
 \nPlease join the Duke SPACE Initiative for a lunch talk and Cube Satelli
 te Club interest meeting on Friday\, April 17th at 12 PM in Pratt Hudson 
 Hall 216.\n\nSamara Aerospace Head of Software\, Kyle Cochran\, will talk
  about the process of designing\, building\, and testing a commercial sat
 ellite bus at a small company with a small team. Starting with the highes
 t level mission design\, what are the steps in-between before slapping on
  that final layer of kapton and sending it up?
