CREATED:20251125T172047Z
DESCRIPTION:Sponsored by the Mary Duke Biddle Foundation\n\nGet ready for 
 a night of laughter\, vocal fireworks\, and theatrical charm as Duke Oper
 a Theater transforms Baldwin Auditorium into the Baldwin Comedy Club for 
 an evening of opera's most delightful comedic scenes. Hosted by stand-up 
 comedian Quinn Thierfelder\, this playful and energetic program celebrate
 s the witty\, chaotic\, and irresistibly entertaining side of opera-with 
 beloved works brought to life by Duke's rising vocal talents.\n\nAudience
 s will experience a curated selection of the genre's funniest moments: sc
 enes filled with mistaken identities\, clever schemes\, rapid-fire ensemb
 les\, and sparkling musical humor. Whether drawn from Mozart's playful ma
 sterpieces\, the bubbling farces of Rossini\, or other gems from the oper
 atic repertoire\, each selection highlights the performers' vocal agility
 \, dramatic flair\, and comedic timing.\n\nQuinn Thierfelder's sharp\, co
 ntemporary humor provides a lively thread throughout the evening\, bridgi
 ng the worlds of stand-up and opera in unexpected and delightful ways. He
 r presence ensures a relaxed\, welcoming atmosphere for newcomers and ope
 ra aficionados alike.\n\nWith its blend of high musical artistry and laug
 h-out-loud theatrical fun\, Opera Night at the Baldwin Comedy Club offers
  a refreshing twist on the classical tradition-and a joyful showcase of D
 uke's vibrant opera community.\n\nFree and open to the public. All are we
 lcome.
DURATION:PT1H30M
