DESCRIPTION:Join us for 4 weeks starting April 19 as we explore Eastertide
  in the Synoptic Gospels and Acts. Each week we will take a look at the p
 ost-Easter story in the final chapters of Matthew\, Mark\, and Luke\, and
  consider what the beginning of Acts has to say to us about being the chu
 rch as a post-Easter people. Co-led by Ryan Wilson and Daniel Parham. Cla
 ss will meet in Westbrook 0013 and by Zoom.\n\nApril 19: Matthew 28\nApri
 l 26: Mark 16\nMay 3: Luke 24\nMay 10: No Bible Study or Worship (graduat
 ion weekend) \nMay 17: Acts 1 & 2
DURATION:PT1H
